{"meta":{"id":"tt38282411","imdb_id":"tt38282411","type":"series","name":"A.B.I.: A Broken Inheritance","poster":"https://live.metahub.space/poster/small/tt38282411/img","background":"https://live.metahub.space/background/medium/tt38282411/img","description":"Dogan is a successful surgeon in Izmir. When he was young, a shocking incident with his father, Tahir Hancıoglu, caused him to break away from his family. Now devoted to saving lives, Dogan has almost no connection with his family except his younger sister, Melek. At Melek’s insistence, Dogan returns to Istanbul for his sister Gulusan’s wedding. His return brings back long-buried traumas and hidden crimes. Dogan meets Cagla, a strong, determined lawyer. Their painful pasts create a deep connection. The family’s enemy, Behram, watches from the shadows, waiting for the right moment to confront the past. An attempted murder on the wedding night changes everything. Old secrets surface and members of his family appear among the suspects. Dogan must make a choice: leave and return to his old life, or stay and face the truth by uncovering the secrets at the heart of his family.","releaseInfo":"2026–2026","imdbRating":"4.9","videos":[{"id":"tt38282411:1:1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt38282411/1/1/w780.jpg","released":"2026-01-13T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt38282411:1:2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt38282411/1/2/w780.jpg","released":"2026-01-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt38282411:1:3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt38282411/1/3/w780.jpg","released":"2026-01-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt38282411:1:4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt38282411/1/4/w780.jpg","released":"2026-02-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt38282411:1:5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.